Reconnection 2 Cases : 

1. User reconnects through different client or session expiry -> Use Retrieve Existing Authorization without any Update

2. User needs Zoho reconnect due to refresh expiry, Zoho auth not valid, need additional scopes, explicit Zoho auth again -> Reauth using Zoho Consent but preserve Auth ID

